            "Neutral"
          ],
          "decisions": [
            "chose",
            "only_option",
            "reacted"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "notes": "Why someone decided as they did (decision log, order tracker). {rival} is the likeliest option not taken; the reasons are what held it back; {doubt} is what weighed against the choice itself.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "chose.neutral.1",
          "text": "{actor} {choice}.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "chose"
          },
          "weight": 0.05
        },
        {
